10	What is Figma?	1	\N	2024-10-27 06:27:06.96929+00	2024-10-27 06:27:06.96932+00	\N	presentations/What_is_Figma___Figma_Explained_in_2_Minutes___UI_UX_Tutorial___Intellipaat.mp4	presentation_thumbnails/Screenshot_2024-10-27_at_11.56.44AM.png	00:00	Figma is a popular design tool designers and teams use worldwide. Figma allows users to collaborate in real-time, and create stunning designs, and prototypes for websites, mobile apps, and more. In this video, you will learn about Figma's user interface, its versatile design features, and how it differs from other design tools in the market. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned pro, this video will provide you with the knowledge and inspiration to create beautiful designs using Figma. So please sit back, relax, and join us on a journey through the world of Figma!	Video		
